nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>토․일요일 및 공휴일 근무 가능자</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○근로기간 : 2010.11.15 ~ 2011.06.30</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○근로시간 : 10:00 ~ 17:00 중 근무를 센터에서 요청하는 시간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○근로단가 : <strong>6,000원/시간</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○접수장소 : 유비쿼터스체험관 행정실 108호</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(주말접수가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">○제출서류 : 근로장학생 신청서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 주민등록등본 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>○면접일자 :</strong> <font color=\"#ff0000\">2010.11.10(수) 오후 2시 ~ 오후 4시<br><!--StartFragment-->\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">○채용안내 : (054)478-7952, 010-3802-2288</font></span></font></p><font color=\"#ff0000\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 18.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">희망자는 근로장학생 신청서(첨부화일)를 작성하고,&nbsp;주민등록등본 1부를 첨부하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">지원자 본인이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 본 센터 행정실(공실관 108호)에 제출 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"></span></p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
